<title>HONG KONG: Yaohan Caterers interim net up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Yaohan Caterers interim net up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.92  vs 13.61</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.13  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    47.76  vs 40.82</p>
<p>    Turnover		     602.15 vs 572.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yaohan International Caterers Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 21-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Yaohan International Caterers is an operator of restaurants and bakeries. Exceptional represents profit arising from sale of an investment property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
